{"last_link_id": 5, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "lyrics_text", "links": [3], "label": "lyrics_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics_text"}], "size": [295.9683532714844, 106], "pos": [845.4144287109375, 647.9796752929688], "widgets_values": ["0.0,0.1,0.2,0.4", 0.4, -1], "inputs": [{"name": "audio_input", "link": 2, "label": "audio_input", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio_input"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature_tuple"}, "name": "temperature_tuple", "label": "temperature_tuple", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "temperature_tuple"}, {"widget": {"name": "no_speech_threshold"}, "name": "no_speech_threshold", "label": "no_speech_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "no_speech_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "logprob_threshold"}, "name": "logprob_threshold", "label": "logprob_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "logprob_threshold"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "HeartMuLa_Transcribe", "properties": {"cnr_id": "heartmula_comfyui", "ver": "1.0.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"temperature_tuple": true, "logprob_threshold": true, "no_speech_threshold": true}, "Node name for S&R": "HeartMuLa_Transcribe"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor":